WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.900
F-15E navigator shot down overnight over Iran — parachuted safely and signaled headquarters.

2
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:17.170
Central command launched an exceptionally complex, daring rescue operation.

3
00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:24.240
The injured Colonel moved through steep terrain, evading Iranian forces.

4
00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:30.300
Air support circled overhead, striking to keep the enemy at bay.

5
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:38.380
Elite rescue units reached him, guiding him to an improvised extraction point.

6
00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:44.440
Two Hercules aircraft waited — but mechanical issues grounded them after boarding.

7
00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:50.500
Three replacement aircraft launched, retrieved all forces, and took off safely.

8
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:58.000
The disabled aircraft were destroyed on-site to keep them from enemy hands.
